# The bazelbuild/bazel revision this patch applies to.
#
# The patch carries the same commit as a `base-commit:` trailer, which is what `git am --3way`
# reads; this file is the greppable form, and `verify.sh` checks the two still agree. A patch whose
# base is not recorded is a patch nobody can tell is stale.
#
# Changing these means re-running `verify.sh` against the new revision: the patch touches
# RemoteAnalysisCachingOptions, FileDependencySerializer and SerializationModule, all of which moved
# between 9.3.1 and master.

